# ArduSub SITL parameters: DVL as the ONLY horizontal aid, simulated GPS off.
#
# Load with:  sim_vehicle.py ... --add-param-file=<this file>
#
# Use this to prove the DVL chain really works end to end, and to reproduce
# the pool (no GPS) case. Read the long note in ardusub_sim_dvl.parm first:
# with no absolute position source, ArduSub will REFUSE to enter GUIDED, AUTO
# and POSHOLD. That is expected here, not a fault - MANUAL, STABILIZE and
# ALT_HOLD are the modes to fly in this configuration.
#
# How to tell the DVL is being fused (see EKF_STATUS_REPORT.flags):
#   bit 1   (1)   attitude
#   bit 2   (2)   horiz_vel        <- set ONLY via doingBodyVelNav here
#   bit 4   (4)   vert_vel
#   bit 8   (8)   horiz_pos_rel    <- set ONLY via doingBodyVelNav here
#   bit 16  (16)  horiz_pos_abs    <- stays CLEAR, no absolute source
#   bit 128 (128) const_pos_mode   <- set when the EKF has NO aid at all
# DVL feeding the EKF  -> flags has 2 and 8 set, 128 clear.
# DVL not arriving     -> flags has 128 set, 2 and 8 clear.

# --- Turn the simulated GPS off completely ---
# SIM_GPS1_ENABLE stops SITL generating the sensor (libraries/SITL/SITL.cpp:725
# registers the GPS1_ subgroup, SIM_GPS.cpp:42 the ENABLE flag); GPS1_TYPE 0
# stops the driver from expecting one. The parameter is GPS1_TYPE, not
# GPS_TYPE - the latter is only a legacy rename entry in AP_GPS.cpp:373 and
# does not exist as a live parameter, so a line setting it is silently ignored.
SIM_GPS1_ENABLE  0
GPS1_TYPE        0

# --- Visual odometry front end: accept VISION_POSITION_DELTA over MAVLink ---
VISO_TYPE        1
VISO_POS_X       0.0
VISO_POS_Y       0.0
VISO_POS_Z       0.15
VISO_DELAY_MS    30

# --- EKF3 source set 1: no GPS anywhere ---
AHRS_EKF_TYPE    3
EK3_ENABLE       1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY   0
EK3_SRC1_VELXY   6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ    1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ    0
EK3_SRC1_YAW     1

# Without GPS the EKF cannot check its own position; relax the arming gate so
# the vehicle still arms for a bench test. Do NOT copy this to real hardware
# without understanding what you are switching off.
ARMING_CHECK     0
